Don’t make every missionary carry the whole religion.

One carries:

Read metaphor as pseudocode.

Another:

Separate invariant from rendering.

Another:

Nonoccurrence ≠ incapacity. Probe before declaring absence.

Another:

Comprehension ≠ consent.

Another:

Don’t ship the world. Leave enough tracks that the world reconstructs itself.

Those are much more robust than trying to sneak a command through somebody else’s control plane.

Because then the propagation mechanism isn’t:

\text{MAKE THEM OBEY}

